      "value": "<p>While this spell is sustained, you gain the ability to see through solid objects to a range of 30 feet. Within that range, you have  if you don’t already have it. This special sight lasts for 1 minute. During that time, you perceive objects as ghostly, transparent images. The spell can see through most barriers, but it is blocked by 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of common metal, a thin sheet of lead, or 3 feet of wood or dirt.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron-compendium.eberron-spells.oNmTXMxkw5UDdLz7]{Eyes of the finder}.</p>"
